{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:04:12.471659+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "We appreciate that you have a strong in-house team; that's the profile of our ideal partners.\n\nEven with top talent, we find many firms experience bottlenecks during periods of high deal flow. This leads me to a question: does your team ever face an analyst backlog when multiple compelling opportunities emerge at once?\n\nWe provide on-demand, supplemental research capacity to help handle that overflow. Our structured analysis allows your core team to focus on the highest-conviction deals without getting spread too thin.\n\nIf you are open to it, I would be happy to schedule a brief call to discuss how we could complement your existing workflow."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:04:30.218732+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 510, "candidates_tokens": 155, "total_tokens": 2418, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:04:30.219198+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "We respect the value of a strong in-house team; our top clients have them as well. That level of internal expertise is irreplaceable for core deal flow.\n\nThis leads to a question: do you find that even with a great team, an analyst backlog develops during high-volume periods, forcing you to pass on opportunities that might otherwise warrant a look?\n\nWe provide supplemental research capacity to help cover those gaps. Our team applies the OrbLabs 6-Pillar DD Framework to deliver structured diligence reports on overflow opportunities. This ensures you maintain broad market coverage while your primary analysts stay focused on top-priority targets, complementing your existing workflow rather than replacing it.\n\nIf you are interested, I can explain the specific components of our 6-Pillar framework."}
