{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:04:45.001721+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "We respect the value of a strong in-house team. Even the most capable teams can face bandwidth constraints during periods of high deal flow.\n\nThis leads me to ask: does your team ever experience a growing analyst backlog when evaluating a high volume of opportunities, potentially causing good deals to be missed?\n\nOur service provides on-demand, supplemental research capacity to help your team focus on the most promising targets. We deliver structured diligence reports based on our 6-Pillar DD Framework, allowing you to scale your evaluation process without scaling your headcount.\n\nIf the need for overflow support arises, we offer a fixed-scope proof of concept engagement at our published list rate of $3,500, with 100% upfront payment."}
