{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:06:16.792456+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 875, "candidates_tokens": 215, "total_tokens": 2704, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:06:16.792868+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. I appreciate the focus on operational rigor.\n\nTo address your questions on operational mechanics:\n\n*   **Execution**: Analyst throughput is measured in \"Reports per Analyst Week.\" Quality is maintained via a peer-review rubric; inter-analyst scoring variance is a core quality metric. Standard DD SLA is 5 business days. We provide a consistent output, allowing you to baseline its utility against your internal velocity.\n*   **GitHub**: Our pipeline uses public APIs to analyze commit frequency, complexity, and contributor distribution. We normalize data against project age to identify sustained, meaningful activity, not just vanity metrics.\n*   **Scoring**: The 6-Pillar framework blends quantitative (e.g., Tokenomics) and qualitative pillars (e.g., Technical Viability). Reproducibility is high (<15% variance) due to our detailed rubric and mandatory peer review for every report.\n\nThe goal is to provide a reliable, structured layer of analysis that reduces the pressure on your core team, ensuring you can consistently evaluate overflow opportunities."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:06:36.994910+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 884, "candidates_tokens": 308, "total_tokens": 3029, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:06:36.995268+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. Transparency on operational mechanics is critical for building trust, and I\u2019m happy to provide detail.\n\nTo address your questions on operational mechanics:\n\n1.  **Execution Power**: We track analyst throughput via a standardized points system per report type and ensure quality through a mandatory peer-review process against a 50-item checklist. Our standard SLA is 5 business days for a structured report. We don't baseline against your team's velocity; instead, we align our delivery cadence to your specific needs for overflow coverage.\n\n2.  **GitHub Methodology**: Our data pipeline uses public APIs at the start of an engagement. We analyze commit frequency, recency, code churn, and contributor history to distinguish core from peripheral developers. To avoid false positives, we normalize these metrics against the project's age and stated team size, with a human analyst always providing the final qualitative interpretation of the data.\n\n3.  **6-Pillar Scoring**: Pillars such as 'Tokenomics' and 'On-Chain Activity' are quantitative, scored against published rubrics. Pillars like 'Team' and 'Technology' are qualitative, assessed via a structured questionnaire to guide analyst judgment. Reproducibility is maintained via blind calibration tests where we target an inter-analyst variance of less than 15% on any single pillar score.\n\nThe goal is to provide a reliable, structured layer of analysis that reduces the pressure on your core team. This operational rigor ensures our supplemental research integrates seamlessly with your workflow."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:07:04.125964+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 877, "candidates_tokens": 215, "total_tokens": 3971, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:07:04.126463+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "These are excellent questions that get to the core of operational rigor. To address your questions on operational mechanics:\n\n1.  **Execution Metrics:** Analyst quality is maintained via peer review and weekly calibration sessions on our framework. Our standard SLA for a report is 5 business days. We provide a consistent external benchmark for your overflow queue, not a direct match to your team's velocity.\n\n2.  **GitHub Methodology:** We pull commit metadata daily via API. We analyze frequency and churn but normalize this data against project age and team size to avoid false positives. The focus is on contextual contribution patterns over raw commit counts.\n\n3.  **Scoring Reproducibility:** Pillars like \u2018On-Chain Activity\u2019 are quantitative; \u2018Team & Execution\u2019 is qualitative but scored against a strict rubric. We enforce <10% score variance between analysts via blind cross-scoring on a subset of engagements to ensure consistency.\n\nThe goal is to provide a reliable, structured layer of analysis that reduces the pressure on your core team, ensuring you can confidently triage the backlog."}
