{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:07:46.902538+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "CONSENSUS_RESULT", "winning_proposal_id": 2, "winning_proposal_text": "Excellent questions. Transparency on operational mechanics is critical for building trust, and I\u2019m happy to provide detail.\n\nTo address your questions on operational mechanics:\n\n1.  **Execution Power**: We track analyst throughput via a standardized points system per report type and ensure quality through a mandatory peer-review process against a 50-item checklist. Our standard SLA is 5 business days for a structured report. We don't baseline against your team's velocity; instead, we align our delivery cadence to your specific needs for overflow coverage.\n\n2.  **GitHub Methodology**: Our data pipeline uses public APIs at the start of an engagement. We analyze commit frequency, recency, code churn, and contributor history to distinguish core from peripheral developers. To avoid false positives, we normalize these metrics against the project's age and stated team size, with a human analyst always providing the final qualitative interpretation of the data.\n\n3.  **6-Pillar Scoring**: Pillars such as 'Tokenomics' and 'On-Chain Activity' are quantitative, scored against published rubrics. Pillars like 'Team' and 'Technology' are qualitative, assessed via a structured questionnaire to guide analyst judgment. Reproducibility is maintained via blind calibration tests where we target an inter-analyst variance of less than 15% on any single pillar score.\n\nThe goal is to provide a reliable, structured layer of analysis that reduces the pressure on your core team. This operational rigor ensures our supplemental research integrates seamlessly with your workflow.", "gemini_calls_swarm": 6}
