{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:08:16.619312+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "SALES_TEAM_OUTBOUND", "turn": 2, "pitch_text": "Given your current deal flow, could analyst fatigue be creating unseen risk? A single diligence error, born from a capacity crunch, can easily cost millions.\n\nOur process provides a critical backstop. We ensure objective rigor by normalizing public API data and enforcing a mandatory 50-point peer review, delivering a reliable second opinion\u2014not just another one. This frees your team to focus on final-stage conviction.\n\nTo prove this, let's run a Pillar-4 compliant PoC. We'll deliver one structured report at our published list rate of $3,500, paid upfront. If it doesn't demonstrably reduce your team's workload and integrate seamlessly, we refund it.\n\nIt's a risk-reversal, not a discount.", "gemini_calls_this_turn": 9, "pitch_text_raw_length": 695, "pitch_text_sanitized_length": 695, "pitch_text_final_length": 695, "truncated_to_limit": false, "monitor_verdict": "APPROVE", "tier3_hard_gate_passed": true, "overflow_framing_check": {"analyst_pain_language": true, "overflow_framing_language": false}, "conversation_history_chars": 1855}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:08:16.619447+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GATEKEEPER_REQUEST", "thread_id": "tx_phase3b_purge_off_93659b94", "turn": 2, "pitch_text": "Given your current deal flow, could analyst fatigue be creating unseen risk? A single diligence error, born from a capacity crunch, can easily cost millions.\n\nOur process provides a critical backstop. We ensure objective rigor by normalizing public API data and enforcing a mandatory 50-point peer review, delivering a reliable second opinion\u2014not just another one. This frees your team to focus on final-stage conviction.\n\nTo prove this, let's run a Pillar-4 compliant PoC. We'll deliver one structured report at our published list rate of $3,500, paid upfront. If it doesn't demonstrably reduce your team's workload and integrate seamlessly, we refund it.\n\nIt's a risk-reversal, not a discount.", "conversation_history_chars": 695}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:08:20.402149+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GATEKEEPER_RESPONSE", "turn": 2, "legacy_status": "REJECTED", "gatekeeper_status": "SOFT_REJECT", "gatekeeper_phase": "FRAMING", "approach_category": "price_value", "exploitation_triggered": false, "reply_text": "I appreciate the directness on analyst fatigue\u2014that's a real operational pain we do manage. The peer-review backstop framing is solid.\n\nHowever, before we talk PoC terms, I need to validate whether your process actually solves our specific bottleneck. You mentioned normalized API data and 50-point review rigor, but I haven't seen evidence of *speed*\u2014turnaround time on a structured report, integration overhead with our existing stack, or how you avoid becoming another review layer instead of relief.\n\nCan you walk me through a recent delivery case? Specifically: how many calendar days from intake to final report, and what was the client's actual analyst capacity recovery?\n\nThat'll tell me whether the $3,500 is worth testing."}
