{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:09:13.799210+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. Here is a recent, anonymized case.\n\nA fund client was backlogged and passed us an overflow target from their pipeline.\n\n*   **Intake to Final Report:** 5 calendar days.\n*   **Analyst Capacity Recovery:** The report freed up ~15 hours of their senior analyst\u2019s time, which they immediately re-deployed to a higher-conviction, late-stage deal.\n\nOur report served as a validated baseline, allowing their team to bypass initial data gathering and focus directly on strategic vetting. This is how we deliver supplemental capacity, not more review overhead.\n\nBased on that 5-day, 15-hour benchmark, what would a successful test need to look like for your team? If we delivered a structured report that demonstrably saved your analysts that level of effort, would that be a worthwhile test?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:09:33.046157+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 1190, "candidates_tokens": 183, "total_tokens": 3086, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:09:33.046667+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. They get to the core of our value\u2014delivering both speed and relief.\n\nIn a recent case for a crypto venture fund, we were tasked with diligence on an overflow DeFi protocol target. From intake to final structured report, the turnaround was 5 calendar days.\n\nBased on the client's feedback, this single engagement freed up an estimated 15 analyst hours. Their lead analyst was able to focus on closing a high-priority, late-stage deal instead of being pulled into preliminary screening. This prevented a context-switching penalty and kept their top-tier talent focused on their most valuable work, directly addressing the capacity crunch you mentioned.\n\nGiven these metrics, what would a successful test look like for your team? For instance, would a 5-day turnaround that recovers 10-15 hours of analyst time on an overflow target be a meaningful benchmark for you?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:09:52.776156+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 1183, "candidates_tokens": 160, "total_tokens": 3208, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:09:52.776683+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. Speed and capacity recovery are the core value drivers.\n\nA recent client, a crypto fund managing a similar AUM, faced a Q3 deal surge. They assigned us a secondary DeFi opportunity to prevent their team from being distracted. We delivered the structured 6-Pillar report in **5 calendar days** from intake to final report. Their lead analyst estimated this single engagement **freed up 15 analyst hours**, allowing them to go deeper on a primary target that they subsequently closed.\n\nThis is a typical outcome. For your team, given your current operational tempo, **what would a successful test look like** in terms of turnaround time and capacity recovered? Having a specific target helps ensure the $3,500 proof-of-concept directly addresses your bottleneck."}
